{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0179_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0179_story_06_title", "source_sha256": "5287be836849f99623fced922a718bad69aac0464a9cebc7cffd42f1f8b56674", "ja": "リリィ・クエスト ～天空の子豚～ 決戦", "zh": "百合任务 ～天空小猪～ 决战", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0179_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0179_story_06_synopsis", "source_sha256": "11c870583f73eac8640fbc20361714285e563afed8364081fe886e181bab425f", "ja": "世界を救うため、いよいよ魔王・朋花との決\n戦に臨む百合子。剣を破壊され劣勢に追い込\nまれるが、みんなから受け継いだ想いを支え\nに奮い立ち、朋花に王手をかける。とどめの\n一撃が放たれる寸前、制止の声が飛んだ！", "zh": "为了拯救世界，百合子终于迎来了与魔王朋花的决战。虽然佩剑被破坏，陷入劣势，但她以大家托付给她的心意为支撑，重新振作起来，将朋花逼入绝境。就在她即将挥出致命一击的瞬间，一声制止传来！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0179_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0179_story_06_1000_026yur", "source_sha256": "28c41239c83e68b8f9e45346add649bc70f648d4652347ce5a412d47d234a180", "ja": "ついに見つけましたよ、魔王！", "zh": "终于找到你了，魔王！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0179_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0179_story_06_1001_031tom", "source_sha256": "9c13c23d92193e4b5b42402f989ca7bc844a9c34262e176243eeb4c7db4b478e", "ja": "あらあら～♪\nずいぶんと早い到着ですね～。", "zh": "哎呀哎呀～♪\n到得挺早的嘛～。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0179_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0179_story_06_1002_028ari", "source_sha256": "644a6f8839059d9cadeec84218eb4ad2ab3beca4717453dde8eae1a934ca2579", "ja": "いったいどうやって……！？", "zh": "到底是怎么做到的……！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0179_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0179_story_06_1003_022ser", "source_sha256": "2c934ef532ea2726d7a06f2ad460a02fb074c2262b4245a33ec6271f7dbd0db7", "ja": "このブロマイドっていうので、魔王城のみなさんたちを\n買収できたんです。みんな心よく通してくれました！", "zh": "用这种叫作照片卡的东西，收买了魔王城的各位。大家都爽快地放我们通过了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0179_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0179_story_06_1004_028ari", "source_sha256": "ba565614d7e233c76d5b46e1f90afa60699cf343d10d345a77d2f0359a390e87", "ja": "なんと！　ありさのせいですか～～！？", "zh": "什么！原来是亚利沙的错吗～～！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0179_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0179_story_06_1005_031tom", "source_sha256": "54a42e79f89a71265e223eaa580a8c05f34d451bd22cf45bf8f962f447025c73", "ja": "うふふ♪　亜利沙さんはもちろんですが……\n子豚ちゃん達にも、おしおきが必要なようですね～。", "zh": "呵呵♪　亚利沙当然逃不掉……\n看来小猪崽们，也需要好好惩罚一下呢～。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0179_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0179_story_06_1006_026yur", "source_sha256": "e05ea330a27075822c133ac9da66c447a78edd480a7bd15811374347d2dc857b", "ja": "おしおきって……。\n民衆をしいたげる、悪逆非道な魔王……。", "zh": "惩罚……。\n压迫民众、无恶不作的魔王……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0179_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0179_story_06_1007_026yur", "source_sha256": "9d713095a16ef9ae986dd4366188aa3b6bef919266c29afc5073bdb846aaeccf", "ja": "あなたを倒すために、\n私は長い道のりをたどってここまで来たの！", "zh": "为了打倒你，我跋山涉水，历经漫长旅途来到这里！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0179_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0179_story_06_1008_031tom", "source_sha256": "b912ed00d93e18339e80ac2980231ca6a67dfad2b99d8b0272187ed1def59f06", "ja": "威勢だけはいいようですね～……ですが、私の愛する\n子豚ちゃん達のためにも負けるわけにはいきません。", "zh": "气势倒是挺足的呢～……不过，为了我所深爱的小猪崽们，我也绝不能输。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0179_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0179_story_06_1009_031tom", "source_sha256": "6fecb189bf015341993e3f66387af203e3f99e4dc97596a15aaa65d1c87e4017", "ja": "今こそ、おのれの未熟さを思い知らせて\nあげましょう～♪　勇者百合子さん～♪", "zh": "现在就让您切身体会一下自己的不成熟吧～♪勇者百合子小姐～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0179_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0179_story_06_1010_026yur", "source_sha256": "591aac60a07b7f3945d669db8addeb9e4ac49b6cfc873a7b76ca158391b03641", "ja": "あなたにはもう誰も傷つけさせはしない。\nはああああっ！", "zh": "我绝不会再让你伤害任何人。\n哈啊啊啊啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0179_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0179_story_06_1011_se", "source_sha256": "16f3c2c399123a8776a8d8b5d28611983b7145708023a539369222e1e400872b", "ja": "ガキーンッ！", "zh": "锵——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0179_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0179_story_06_1012_026yur", "source_sha256": "f7c74810852e6368e69d4100133a9e697eca3fb6a5873d7010de6be129cf1aba", "ja": "剣が……。", "zh": "剑……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0179_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0179_story_06_1013_031tom", "source_sha256": "3dec35f072ec7b03a940290f71f0fdb33f8badbee548cec9e33ba1dd599f069b", "ja": "軽い攻撃ですね～。\n他愛もない……子猫のじゃれあいのようですね～。", "zh": "真是轻微的攻击呢～。不值一提……简直就像小猫在嬉闹一样呢～。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0179_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0179_story_06_1014_031tom", "source_sha256": "ff7b66d7824a9f2b36f13e4e883abbd226b664f081ae7af3d0ebf1ade3b4fd79", "ja": "剣がなければ何もできませんか～？\n何の力もない村娘……あなたはそうだったはずです～。", "zh": "没有剑就什么都做不了吗～？\n没有任何力量的村姑……你本来应该是这样的～。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0179_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0179_story_06_1015_026yur", "source_sha256": "cce327be7fb467e14fa998eabcc0f5598a7ee4318c9f537111853419860c3f66", "ja": "…………。……さない。", "zh": "…………。……不会放弃的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0179_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0179_story_06_1016_031tom", "source_sha256": "698bceb8b2cde22b3e18c7997b79111a01188443db7d58daa8772fe9dfeca06c", "ja": "え？", "zh": "咦？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0179_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0179_story_06_1017_022ser", "source_sha256": "8bc7bb30b4b36c43593afa72c96a8928fe91c9ef2064902fcb81d3f265852e06", "ja": "百合子さんの目の前に、光が……！", "zh": "百合子小姐的眼前出现了光……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0179_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0179_story_06_1018_028ari", "source_sha256": "04cc294209eec81aebe7ed3885927cb96ddc23873ae5b3f2b56f4fcbf78c06cd", "ja": "勇者ちゃんのそばに剣が！\nでもいったい、どこから……。", "zh": "勇者的身边出现了剑！\n但到底是从哪里……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0179_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0179_story_06_1019_031tom", "source_sha256": "1e3e190a5cca04ed27fcf52c185c960d36d810375e11a6bdfa1d78d7a9d97718", "ja": "まさか、勇者自身が剣を生み出した……？\nそんな……！？", "zh": "难道说，是勇者自己创造出了剑……？\n怎么会……！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0179_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0179_story_06_1020_026yur", "source_sha256": "99920330de314a558487ef4c5f85f713389a8c7ce02c3e7fe9dd4584524ecdeb", "ja": "剣がなければ、私はただの村娘かもしれない。\nでも私は、剣を手放さない！", "zh": "如果没有剑，我或许只是个普通的村姑。\n但我绝不会放下这把剑！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0179_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0179_story_06_1021_026yur", "source_sha256": "d40881c660e9a819f67717a02a801138c44f65a4503dca9514a510384f5911d8", "ja": "だってこの剣は、この大陸のみんなの希望だから！\n私が勇者でいられるのは、みんなの想いを……。", "zh": "因为这把剑，是这片大陆上所有人的希望啊！\n我之所以能继续当勇者，是因为承载着大家的心愿……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0179_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0179_story_06_1022_026yur", "source_sha256": "d2a0626a9156c132f236d68ad296e1a094acb35cb056a4a510d2c22ac11eb43e", "ja": "希望を預かっているから。\nだから、なんて言われても、私は剣を持ち続ける！", "zh": "因为我肩负着大家的希望。\n所以，不管别人怎么说，我都要继续拿着这把剑！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0179_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0179_story_06_1023_026yur", "source_sha256": "8b22e9378e0c56f795b6a84d4d48032fc69a9aa4935542d1639892e446392e7d", "ja": "勇者であり続ける！　はぁぁあ！", "zh": "我会一直当勇者！哈啊啊啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0179_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0179_story_06_1024_031tom", "source_sha256": "7cb4c05b7f6d4074a441a05ae4663400e6af3595b51e84e5e36b61b6bbd4e3a4", "ja": "……っ！　早い……。", "zh": "……唔！好快……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0179_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0179_story_06_1025_se", "source_sha256": "6b2728d9040795022cf81cd776057d8b1aa2a5a505585afee672d4d9d61d5627", "ja": "ガキーンッ！！", "zh": "铛——！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0179_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0179_story_06_1026_031tom", "source_sha256": "87494971da169415ac2e1728f080b18018226c08e3f3fb14e6b19e177360092e", "ja": "くっ……。", "zh": "咕……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0179_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0179_story_06_1027_025roc", "source_sha256": "4b891f4b7cb9fec6147bdad872964a0003c45e83267539c7007cc303c80d09c1", "ja": "あわわっ！\n今度はトモカのワンドが遠くに！", "zh": "啊哇哇！\n这次是朋花的魔杖飞到远处了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0179_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0179_story_06_1028_022ser", "source_sha256": "5f5d11b68373e2801a3680a0fa253875ce7846c65e924e1747f8c7ecda42e602", "ja": "すごい……。\n百合子さん、形勢逆転です！", "zh": "好厉害……\n百合子小姐，局势逆转了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0179_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0179_story_06_1029_026yur", "source_sha256": "546fdb9897267a05af4d7297cbd870e6c7128e32fa0464dfe97993fb11bcead7", "ja": "あなたはあまりにも多くの民をしいたげた。\n覚悟はいいですか？", "zh": "你残害了太多的人民。\n做好觉悟了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
